   "id": "302d554bce",
   "where": "p · You're going to feel good",
   "original": "We believe people achieve more when they're energized, inspired and supported. GHF at Tioga Town Center provides that environment for members, their families and guests alike.",
   "text": "We believe people achieve more when they're energized, inspired and supported. GHF at Tioga Town Center provides that environment for members, their families and guests alike."
